###################################################################################################################################################
# Relations of UTC with predictions of UTC broadcast by GNSS                                                       (Created 22/05/2024)           #
# This file reports the difference between UTC and the time scales related to the GNSS systems.                                                   #
# The method used to obtain these values is described in http://dx.doi.org/10.1088/1681-7575/ad0562 (P Defraigne et al 2023 Metrologia 60 065010) #
# Further details in the "EXPLANATORY SUPPLEMENT OF BIPM CIRCULAR T".                                                                             #
# "UTC-bUTC_GNSS" indicates the differences between UTC and its prediction broadcast by GNSS ( with GNSS = GPS,GLO,GAL,BDS)                       #
# "UTC-GNSST" indicates the difference between UTC and the GNSS time scale, modulo 1 second.                                                      #
# "Sigma" represents a conservative monthly estimate of the uncertainty. This is not to the complete uncertainty with which a user can link its   #
# local time scale to UTC using a GNSS receiver.                                                                                                  #
# "Used_receivers" indicated the multiGNSS calibrated receivers used in the computation.                                                          #
#                                                                                                                                                 #
# Difference in the entire number of seconds between UTC and the GNSS time scales:                                                                #
##[UTC-GPS time] :          (19-xx) s                                                                                                             #
##[UTC-GLONASS time] :           0  s                                                                                                             #
##[UTC-GALILEO time]:       (19-xx) s                                                                                                             #
##[UTC-BEIDOU time]:        (33-xx) s                                                                                                             #
# where xx is the integer number of leap seconds applied since 1972, available in                                                                 #
# https://hpiers.obspm.fr/eoppc/bul/bulc/Leap_Second.dat .                                                                                        #
#                                                                                                                                                 #
# This file contains:                                                                                                                             #
# col 1 : MJD /day                                                                                                                                #
# col 2 : UTC-bUTC_GNSS /ns                                                                                                                       #
# col 3 : UTC-GNSST /ns                                                                                                                           #
# col 4 : sigma /ns                                                                                                                               #
# col 5 : used receivers                                                                                                                          #
#                                                                                                                                                 #
# Notes:                                                                                                                                          #
# Starting from MJD 60430, the previous file https://webtai.bipm.org/ftp/pub/tai/other-products/utcgnss/utc-gnss                                  #
# is not updated anymore and 4 new files are created (one per GNSS constellation).                                                                #
#                                                                                                                                                 #
